<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">Season 2026 · Now Recruiting</div>
    <h1>Your gym. Their gym.<br><span class="accent">One winner.</span></h1>
    <p class="sub">Six weeks. Four gates. Twelve exercises. Every rep counted, every category head to head, until one team's name is on top.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a href="/signup/athlete" class="btn btn-primary">Sign Up to Compete</a>
    </div>
    <a href="/signup/gym" class="hero-secondary">Running a gym? Register your team instead →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="text-align:center;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">What Is GL?</div>
    <h2>4 gates. 12 exercises. One winner.</h2>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;">Hit the benchmark, beat the athlete standing across from you, and your team's points go on the board.</p>
    <div class="fact-strip">
      <div class="fact">Gym <b>v</b> Gym</div>
      <div class="fact"><b>6</b>-Week Season</div>
      <div class="fact"><b>5</b> Categories per Match</div>
    </div>
    <a href="/how-it-works" class="btn btn-dark">See Exactly How It Works</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">For Competitors</div>
    <h2>What's in it for you</h2>
    <div class="hero-point">
      <div class="tag">The big one</div>
      <h3>A real opponent, every single week.</h3>
      <p>Not an abstract leaderboard — a specific athlete in your category on the other team. Beat them, and your team feels it directly on the scoreboard.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="minor-grid">
      <div class="minor"><h4>Compete with yourself</h4><p>Every rep and time tracked, so your own progress is always visible.</p></div>
      <div class="minor"><h4>One-click sign up</h4><p>No admin back-and-forth — pick or get assigned a team and you're in.</p></div>
      <div class="minor"><h4>Study your own form</h4><p>Wedgetail flags reps worth a second look, for you and your coach.</p></div>
      <div class="minor"><h4>Results, shareable</h4><p>Your full history, one link away from your coach's inbox.</p></div>
      <div class="minor"><h4>Your team's on the line too</h4><p>Your score rolls straight into a team result — never just a number.</p></div>
      <div class="minor"><h4>A real community</h4><p>Rivals on the floor, community off it — new faces every week.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:1.6rem;">
      <a href="/signup/athlete" class="btn btn-primary">Sign Up to Compete</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">For Gyms</div>
    <h2>Why gyms partner with GL</h2>
    <div class="hero-point">
      <div class="tag">The big one</div>
      <h3>A team is stickier than a membership.</h3>
      <p>Once someone's on a team, they're not just a member — they're a teammate. That's a much harder thing to walk away from than a class booking.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="minor-grid">
      <div class="minor"><h4>Hyrox-style training, built in</h4><p>The gate structure doubles as an excellent training base — no programming from scratch.</p></div>
      <div class="minor"><h4>Revenue, not a cost</h4><p>A program members pay to join, not a fee going out the door.</p></div>
      <div class="minor"><h4>Wedgetail does the counting</h4><p>Automatic rep tracking means coaches spend less time on the clipboard.</p></div>
      <div class="minor"><h4>A magnet for new members</h4><p>People looking for a team to belong to, not just a class to attend.</p></div>
      <div class="minor"><h4>Real in-gym community</h4><p>Six weeks working toward a shared weekly result builds real camaraderie.</p></div>
      <div class="minor"><h4>Full control of your roster</h4><p>You decide who competes where, week to week.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:1.6rem;">
      <a href="/signup/gym" class="btn btn-primary">Register Your Gym</a>
      <a href="/guide/gym" class="btn btn-outline" style="border-color:var(--forest);color:var(--forest);margin-left:1rem;">Read the Gym Operator Guide</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--border);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">Regions</div>
    <h2>Find your region</h2>
    <p class="lede">Gym League Global is rolling out region by region, Football-Australia style — starting in Sydney's North Shore.</p>
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <% regions.forEach(r => { %>
        <div class="card region-card">
          <div>
            <div class="rname"><%= r.name %></div>
          </div>
          <% if (r.status === 'active') { %>
            <a href="/regions/<%= r.slug %>" class="badge badge-live"><%= r.status_label || 'Live' %> — View</a>
          <% } else { %>
            <span class="badge badge-soon">Coming Soon</span>
          <% } %>
        </div>
      <% }) %>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:1.5rem;">
      <a href="/signup/league" class="btn btn-outline" style="border-color:var(--forest);color:var(--forest);">Want to run a region? Apply here</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


